IGEL_APPLE_ACPI
	  This change fixes acpica for zero arguments acpi calls.

	  Source: External
	  URL: https://github.com/t2linux/linux-t2-patches/blob/6.1/2001-fix-acpica-for-zero-arguments-acpi-calls.patch

source "drivers/hid/amd-sfh-hid/Kconfig"
diff --git a/drivers/acpi/acpica/dswexec.c b/drivers/acpi/acpica/dswexec.c
